<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Anglo calls news conf with Harmony,Freegold.</title>
<headline>Anglo calls news conf with Harmony,Freegold.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Anglo American Corp of South Africa Ltd said on Thursday that it was holding a news conference with Harmony Gold Mining Co Ltd and Free State Consolidated Gold Mines Ltd (Freegold) at 1400 GMT.</p>
<p>An Anglo spokeswoman declined to say what would be announced at the conference.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
